From bc8b059292264a7256012fc4b0627d31c37bd6a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HuaWen CHEN <quic_huawenc@quicinc.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Mar 2024 12:53:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] odhcpd: Add support for IPV6 NS DAD packet forwarding
 logic

Support to forward IPv6 NS-DAD packets received on the bridge
towards Modem to address a potential IPv6 address conflict.

Signed-off-by: aryamali <quic_aryamali@quicinc.com>
